  _recipeBookDescriptionUnspoiled: 
  _recipeBookDescriptionSpoiled: "It looks engorged upon itself, bursting at the
    seams. Of course, there isn\u2019t much fresh seafood in Verehn anymore, but
    it\u2019s somewhat reminiscent of the finely cut fish amidst a bed of savory
    seaweed. Now, it more resembles a sick pastry. But don\u2019t worry. Chefs in
    Verehn today are not above preying on nostalgia. Anything for a paying customer. "
